      "writtenOn": "2017-07-07T17:41:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s safe to assume the layouts of the two RW regions are identical and their distance will remain CONFIG_RW_SIZE. The reason I like my version is it expresses this identical-ness in the code. When you make a change to RW_A, it\u0027ll be automatically reflected on RW_B.\n\nAdded comments for clarification.",
      "parentUuid": "475cdcc4_4177110c",
      "revId": "2b8bb9c9709799b54793683529da9ec5356adfa7",
